    },
    "motifs": [
      "cold",
      "telephone",
      "office"
    ],
    "weather": "cold",
    "status": "placeholder"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-001",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "The landlady's note was still folded in my coat, unread twice already.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "midnight-2",
      "caseState": "cold",
      "circumstance": "behind-on-rent"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "paper",
      "coat"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-002",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I thought about the rent for exactly as long as it took to light a cigarette.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "midnight-2",
      "caseState": "warm",
      "circumstance": "behind-on-rent"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "cigarette",
      "money"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-003",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "Even with the case moving, the rent didn't care either way.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "midnight-2",
      "caseState": "hot",
      "circumstance": "behind-on-rent"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "money"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-004",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "Four days late on the rent and I still hadn't worked out which four.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "midnight-2",
      "caseState": "tight",
      "circumstance": "behind-on-rent"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "money"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-005",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "The landlady would be up at seven asking, same as she'd asked all week.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "2-4",
      "caseState": "cold",
      "circumstance": "behind-on-rent"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-006",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "A little luck on this one might cover March, if it broke my way.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "2-4",
      "caseState": "warm",
      "circumstance": "behind-on-rent"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-007",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "The rent was the last thing on my mind, which was its own kind of luck.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "2-4",
      "caseState": "hot",
      "circumstance": "behind-on-rent"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "money"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-008",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I did the math on the rent again and it still came out short.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "2-4",
      "caseState": "tight",
      "circumstance": "behind-on-rent"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "money"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-009",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "By six she'd be knocking, and I still had nothing to hand her.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "4-6",
      "caseState": "cold",
      "circumstance": "behind-on-rent"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "hands"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-010",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I let myself think, for a minute, about paying her in full for once.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "4-6",
      "caseState": "warm",
      "circumstance": "behind-on-rent"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-011",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "The rent could wait one more day if this kept moving the way it was.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "4-6",
      "caseState": "hot",
      "circumstance": "behind-on-rent"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "money"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-012",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I owed six weeks and had maybe six hours to make a dent in it.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "4-6",
      "caseState": "tight",
      "circumstance": "behind-on-rent"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-013",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "The landlady's door was already open when I came in, which meant she'd been waiting.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "6-8",
      "caseState": "cold",
      "circumstance": "behind-on-rent"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "door"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-014",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I'd have something for her by Friday, probably, if this held together.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "6-8",
      "caseState": "warm",
      "circumstance": "behind-on-rent"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-015",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "The rent notice was still on the hall table where I'd left it, unanswered.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "6-8",
      "caseState": "hot",
      "circumstance": "behind-on-rent"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "money"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-016",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "Whatever this case paid, it wouldn't touch what I owed already.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "6-8",
      "caseState": "tight",
      "circumstance": "behind-on-rent"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-017",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I had money in my pocket for once and nowhere worth spending it.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "midnight-2",
      "caseState": "cold",
      "circumstance": "flush"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "money"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-018",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "The roll in my coat felt good against my ribs, which wasn't like me.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "midnight-2",
      "caseState": "warm",
      "circumstance": "flush"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "money",
      "coat"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-019",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "Being flush didn't make the night go any faster.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "midnight-2",
      "caseState": "hot",
      "circumstance": "flush"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-020",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "Money in the pocket doesn't buy back an hour, whatever they say about it.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "midnight-2",
      "caseState": "tight",
      "circumstance": "flush"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "money"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-021",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I could afford a cab and walked anyway, out of habit more than sense.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "2-4",
      "caseState": "cold",
      "circumstance": "flush"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-022",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "For once I wasn't counting nickels while I waited.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "2-4",
      "caseState": "warm",
      "circumstance": "flush"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "money"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-023",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "The extra cash sat easy in my pocket, which felt strange this late in a case.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "2-4",
      "caseState": "hot",
      "circumstance": "flush"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "late",
      "money"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-024",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I'd have paid double for an extra hour, if that was something money bought.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "2-4",
      "caseState": "tight",
      "circumstance": "flush"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "money"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-025",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I thought about a new coat, then thought better of thinking about it.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "4-6",
      "caseState": "cold",
      "circumstance": "flush"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "coat"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-026",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "Flush or not, four in the morning is four in the morning.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "4-6",
      "caseState": "warm",
      "circumstance": "flush"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "dawn"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-027",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "The money would keep. The case wouldn't.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "4-6",
      "caseState": "hot",
      "circumstance": "flush"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "money"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-028",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I could have hired a second pair of eyes if I'd had the sense to plan ahead.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "4-6",
      "caseState": "tight",
      "circumstance": "flush"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "eyes"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-029",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I'd eat somewhere decent later, if later ever came.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "6-8",
      "caseState": "cold",
      "circumstance": "flush"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-030",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "Being able to pay for breakfast without counting it out felt almost indulgent.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "6-8",
      "caseState": "warm",
      "circumstance": "flush"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "food"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-031",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I noticed I wasn't thinking about money at all, and that was new.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "6-8",
      "caseState": "hot",
      "circumstance": "flush"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "money"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-032",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "Whatever this paid, it wouldn't be worth what the last six hours had cost me.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "6-8",
      "caseState": "tight",
      "circumstance": "flush"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-033",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "My head still hadn't forgiven me for last night.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "midnight-2",
      "caseState": "cold",
      "circumstance": "hungover"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-034",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "The ache behind my eyes kept better time than my watch did.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "midnight-2",
      "caseState": "warm",
      "circumstance": "hungover"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "clock",
      "eyes"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-035",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I could have used a glass of water two hours ago.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "midnight-2",
      "caseState": "hot",
      "circumstance": "hungover"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "glass"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-036",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "My head was pounding in time with my own footsteps, which wasn't helping.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "midnight-2",
      "caseState": "tight",
      "circumstance": "hungover"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "footsteps"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-037",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "The taste in my mouth hadn't improved with the walking.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "2-4",
      "caseState": "cold",
      "circumstance": "hungover"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "mouth"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-038",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I blamed the whiskey for the headache and the case for everything else.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "2-4",
      "caseState": "warm",
      "circumstance": "hungover"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "drink"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-039",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "My stomach reminded me, twice, that I'd skipped dinner for the wrong reasons.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "2-4",
      "caseState": "hot",
      "circumstance": "hungover"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "food"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-040",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "The headache made the thinking slower, which was the worst time for it.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "2-4",
      "caseState": "tight",
      "circumstance": "hungover"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-041",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "By this hour the hangover had settled into something almost familiar.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "4-6",
      "caseState": "cold",
      "circumstance": "hungover"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-042",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "A cup of coffee would have fixed half of what was wrong with me.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "4-6",
      "caseState": "warm",
      "circumstance": "hungover"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "drink"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-043",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I kept blinking against a light that wasn't even that bright.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "4-6",
      "caseState": "hot",
      "circumstance": "hungover"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "eyes"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-044",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "My head throbbed once for every minute I didn't have to spare.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "4-6",
      "caseState": "tight",
      "circumstance": "hungover"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-045",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "The morning light didn't do the headache any favors.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "6-8",
      "caseState": "cold",
      "circumstance": "hungover"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "dawn"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-046",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I promised myself, not for the first time, to cut it out.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "6-8",
      "caseState": "warm",
      "circumstance": "hungover"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-047",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "The hangover was fading, finally, right about when I needed my head clear.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "6-8",
      "caseState": "hot",
      "circumstance": "hungover"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-048",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I'd have traded the whole night for one more hour of sleep and a clear head.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "6-8",
      "caseState": "tight",
      "circumstance": "hungover"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "sleep"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-049",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "My ribs reminded me about it every time I turned too fast.",
