      "caseState": "hot",
      "circumstance": "bruised"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-060",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I didn't have the time to favor the bad side, so I stopped.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "4-6",
      "caseState": "tight",
      "circumstance": "bruised"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-061",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "The morning cold got into the bruise first, before anywhere else.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "6-8",
      "caseState": "cold",
      "circumstance": "bruised"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "cold",
      "dawn"
    ],
    "weather": "cold",
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-062",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I'd need a week off the bad side, and I wasn't likely to get it.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "6-8",
      "caseState": "warm",
      "circumstance": "bruised"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-063",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "The ribs would keep me honest about how fast I could move today.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "6-8",
      "caseState": "hot",
      "circumstance": "bruised"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-064",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "Whatever came next, it was going to hurt, and I was already tired of it hurting.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "6-8",
      "caseState": "tight",
      "circumstance": "bruised"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-065",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "The last job had been two people hating each other over a bank book, and I was glad it was over.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "midnight-2",
      "caseState": "cold",
      "circumstance": "off-a-divorce-case"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "work"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-066",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I still had a taste in my mouth from the last case, and it wasn't whiskey.",
