      "hourBand": "midnight-2",
      "caseState": "hot",
      "circumstance": "sleepless"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "drink"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-084",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I couldn't remember the last full night's sleep I'd had, and didn't try very hard to.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "midnight-2",
      "caseState": "tight",
      "circumstance": "sleepless"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "sleep"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-085",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "My body wanted to sit down somewhere and not get up for a while.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "2-4",
      "caseState": "cold",
      "circumstance": "sleepless"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-086",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I'd stopped counting the hours since I'd slept, somewhere around the second night.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "2-4",
      "caseState": "warm",
      "circumstance": "sleepless"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-087",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "The lack of sleep made everything feel one step removed, a pane of glass between me and it.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "2-4",
      "caseState": "hot",
      "circumstance": "sleepless"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "glass",
      "window",
      "sleep"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-088",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I was past being nervous, too tired for it, which was its own kind of trouble.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "2-4",
      "caseState": "tight",
      "circumstance": "sleepless"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-089",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "The tired had gone past aching into something flatter, my whole body past complaining about it.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "4-6",
      "caseState": "cold",
      "circumstance": "sleepless"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-090",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I told myself I'd sleep after, same as I told myself every night this week.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "4-6",
      "caseState": "warm",
      "circumstance": "sleepless"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "sleep"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-091",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "My hands had a small shake to them that wasn't nerves, just exhaustion.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "4-6",
      "caseState": "hot",
      "circumstance": "sleepless"
    },
    "motifs": [
      "hands"
    ],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-092",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "I couldn't afford to stop moving long enough to feel how tired I really was.",
    "tags": {
      "hourBand": "4-6",
      "caseState": "tight",
      "circumstance": "sleepless"
    },
    "motifs": [],
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "amb-093",
    "deck": "ambient",
    "text": "The morning light hurt more than it should have, on no sleep.",
